{# table; title: Mappings; category: docs #}

`<prefix>` is `<Leader>;` unless `mappings.prefix` says otherwise. A mapping is changed or turned off in the setup, under the name in the last column:
`mappings = { fey = { fey_refile = '<prefix>R' } }`, or `false` to turn it off. The list is made from the configuration, so it is what is mapped.

  I. The default mappings

#[ comment ] begin generated: mappings (scripts/gen_docs.lua) #

`<prefix>` is `<Leader>;` unless `mappings.prefix` says otherwise. A mapping is changed or turned off in
the setup, under the name in the last column: `mappings = { fey = { fey_refile = "<prefix>R" } }`, or
`false` to turn it off.

Anywhere:

| keys       | does                                                                   | name                |
+============+========================================================================+=====================+
| <prefix>a  | Open the agenda prompt                                                 | fey_agenda          |
| <prefix>c  | Capture a new note or task                                             | fey_capture         |
| <prefix>bn | Open a new database view of all files in the vault                     | fey_db_new          |
| <prefix>bc | Open a new database view in the current window, full screen            | fey_db_new_current  |
| <prefix>bs | Open a new database view in a horizontal split                         | fey_db_new_split    |
| <prefix>bt | Open a new database view in a new tab                                  | fey_db_new_tab      |
| <prefix>bv | Open a new database view in a vertical split                           | fey_db_new_vsplit   |
| <prefix>bl | Pick an existing database to open                                      | fey_db_pick         |
| <prefix>bL | Pick an existing database and open it in the current window            | fey_db_pick_current |
| <prefix>vi | Make the cwd a hollow (create its .fey folder) and index its Fey files | fey_hollow_init     |
| <prefix>vj | Browse the hollows from the court down and jump to one                 | fey_hollow_jump     |
| <prefix>vJ | Browse the hollows and open the one you pick in a new tab              | fey_hollow_jump_tab |
| <prefix>vr | Update the vault index                                                 | fey_vault_reindex   |

In Fey files:

| keys                  | does                                                                                            | name                                               |
+=======================+=================================================================================================+====================================================+
| <prefix>na            | Add a note to the current heading                                                               | fey_add_note                                       |
| <prefix>haf           | make all segments of signature anonymous                                                        | fey_anonymize_heading                              |
| <prefix>hae           | make {count} segments of signature from end anonymous                                           | fey_anonymize_heading_from_end                     |
| <prefix>has           | make {count} segments of signature from start anonymous                                         | fey_anonymize_heading_from_start                   |
| <prefix>?a            | Apply the settings of the note: the nvim and plugin tags of the court, the hollow and the note  | fey_apply_all_settings                             |
| <prefix>?t            | Apply the nvim or plugin tag under the cursor                                                   | fey_apply_settings_at_tag                          |
| <prefix>$             | Archive subtree to archive file                                                                 | fey_archive_subtree                                |
| <prefix>yc            | List in quickfix the references that name no block and the targets two files write              | fey_babel_check                                    |
| <prefix>yt            | Write the source blocks of this file that have a :tangle target                                 | fey_babel_tangle                                   |
| <prefix>yv            | Write the source blocks that have a :tangle target of every file of this hollow                 | fey_babel_tangle_vault                             |
| [[                    | Go to previous heading at the same level                                                        | fey_backward_heading_same_level                    |
| <prefix>hde           | update all delimiters to prompted value from end                                                | fey_change_all_delimiters_from_end                 |
| <prefix>hds           | update all delimiters to prompted value from start                                              | fey_change_all_delimiters_from_start               |
| cid                   | Change date under cursor via calendar popup                                                     | fey_change_date                                    |
| <prefix>ld            | update all delimiters of current list (not sublists) to prompted value                          | fey_change_list_delimiters                         |
| <prefix>lc            | List in quickfix the links and sections of this hollow that lead nowhere                        | fey_check_links                                    |
| <prefix>xq            | Cancel active clock on current heading                                                          | fey_clock_cancel                                   |
| <prefix>xj            | Jump to currently clocked in heading                                                            | fey_clock_goto                                     |
| <prefix>xi            | Clock in current heading                                                                        | fey_clock_in                                       |
| <prefix>xo            | Clock out current heading                                                                       | fey_clock_out                                      |
| <TAB>                 | Toggle folding                                                                                  | fey_cycle                                          |
| <C-x>                 | Decrease date part under cursor (year/month/day/hour/minute/repeater/active\|inactive)          | fey_date_down                                      |
| <S-DOWN>              | Decrease date by one day                                                                        | fey_date_down_day                                  |
| <prefix>i.            | Insert date under cursor                                                                        | fey_date_insert                                    |
| <prefix>i!            | Insert/Update inactive date under cursor                                                        | fey_date_insert_inactive                           |
| <C-a>                 | Increase date part under cursor (year/month/day/hour/minute/repeater/active\|inactive)          | fey_date_up                                        |
| <S-UP>                | Increase date by one day                                                                        | fey_date_up_day                                    |
| <prefix>id            | Insert/Update deadline date                                                                     | fey_deadline                                       |
| <prefix>L             | Demote whole subtree                                                                            | fey_demote_subtree                                 |
| ><                    | Demote heading                                                                                  | fey_do_demote                                      |
| <>                    | Promote heading                                                                                 | fey_do_promote                                     |
| <prefix>'             | Edit the source block under the cursor in another buffer                                        | fey_edit_special                                   |
| <prefix>hef           | make all segments of signature enumerated                                                       | fey_enumerate_heading                              |
| <prefix>hee           | make {count} segments of signature from end indexed                                             | fey_enumerate_heading_from_end                     |
| <prefix>hes           | make {count} segments of signature from start indexed                                           | fey_enumerate_heading_from_start                   |
| <prefix>e             | Export this file: Markdown, HTML, iCalendar, or LaTeX, PDF, Word, EPUB through pandoc           | fey_export                                         |
| <prefix>fi            | Assert indentation for subsection                                                               | fey_fix_indentation                                |
| ]]                    | Go to next heading at the same level                                                            | fey_forward_heading_same_level                     |
| <S-TAB>               | Toggle folding (whole file)                                                                     | fey_global_cycle                                   |
| <prefix><c-k>         | move the cursor to the cell above                                                               | fey_goto_to_cell_above                             |
| <prefix><c-j>         | move the cursor the cell below                                                                  | fey_goto_to_cell_below                             |
| <prefix><c-l>         | move the curosr to the next cell                                                                | fey_goto_to_cell_next                              |
| <prefix><c-h>         | move the cursor to the previous cell                                                            | fey_goto_to_cell_prev                              |
| <prefix>nf            | Write a footnote reference at the cursor and its definition, ready to type                      | fey_insert_footnote                                |
| <prefix>ih            | Add new heading after current subtree                                                           | fey_insert_heading_respect_content                 |
| <prefix>li            | Insert or Update a hyperlink under cursor. Visual selection used as description                 | fey_insert_link                                    |
| <prefix>iH            | Add new subheading after current subtree                                                        | fey_insert_subheading_respect_content              |
| <prefix>iT            | Add new TODO heading on line right after current line                                           | fey_insert_todo_heading                            |
| <prefix>it            | Add new TODO heading after current subtree                                                      | fey_insert_todo_heading_respect_content            |
| <Leader><CR>          | Add heading at {count} level, list item or checkbox (context aware)                             | fey_meta_return                                    |
| <Leader><S-CR>        | Add subheading at curr+{1 or count} level, list item or checkbox (context aware)                | fey_meta_sub_return                                |
| <prefix>J             | Move subtree down                                                                               | fey_move_subtree_down                              |
| <prefix>K             | Move subtree up                                                                                 | fey_move_subtree_up                                |
| }                     | Go to next heading (any level)                                                                  | fey_next_visible_heading                           |
| <prefix>o             | Follow the link or section tag under the cursor                                                 | fey_open_at_point                                  |
| {                     | Go to previous heading (any level)                                                              | fey_previous_visible_heading                       |
| <prefix>,             | Change the priority of the current heading                                                      | fey_priority                                       |
| cir                   | Decrease priority of heading                                                                    | fey_priority_down                                  |
| ciR                   | Increase priority of heading                                                                    | fey_priority_up                                    |
| <prefix>H             | Promote whole subtree                                                                           | fey_promote_subtree                                |
| <prefix>qa            | Run every query tag in the buffer and write their results                                       | fey_query_run_all                                  |
| <prefix>qq            | Run the query tag under the cursor and write its result as a table or list below it             | fey_query_run_at_tag                               |
| <prefix>r             | Refile heading to specific destination                                                          | fey_refile                                         |
| <prefix>fI            | triggers and automatic reindex of a list or headings                                            | fey_reindex_headings_or_list                       |
| <CR>                  | Insert mode: move through a table, keep the indentation of a paragraph or list item             | fey_return                                         |
| <prefix>!a            | Run the buffer commands of the note (only when settings.hooks names their keys)                 | fey_run_all_buffer_commands                        |
| <prefix>!t            | Run the buffer commands of the tag under the cursor (only when settings.hooks names their keys) | fey_run_buffer_commands_at_tag                     |
| <prefix>is            | Insert/Update scheduled date                                                                    | fey_schedule                                       |
| <prefix>sc            | Pick the state of the checkbox of the list item (in progress, important, note ...)              | fey_set_checkbox_state                             |
| <prefix>xe            | Set effort estimate on current heading                                                          | fey_set_effort                                     |
| <prefix>sl            | Change labels of current heading                                                                | fey_set_labels_command                             |
| g?                    | Show this help                                                                                  | fey_show_help                                      |
| <prefix>ls            | Store link to current heading                                                                   | fey_store_link                                     |
| <prefix>tc            | insert table after current line using count or obtained input. default 2x2                      | fey_table_create_after                             |
| <prefix>tC            | insert table before curent line using count or obtained input. default 2x2                      | fey_table_create_before                            |
| <prefix>tdc           | delete the current col under cursor                                                             | fey_table_delete_col                               |
| <prefix>tdr           | delete the current row under curosr                                                             | fey_table_delete_row                               |
| <prefix>tie           | inserts a logical row bounary end line after the current row                                    | fey_table_insert_boundary_end_after                |
| <prefix>tiE           | inserts a logical row bounary end line before the current row                                   | fey_table_insert_boundary_end_before               |
| <prefix>tii           | inserts a logical row inner boundary line after the current row                                 | fey_table_insert_boundary_inner_after              |
| <prefix>tiI           | inserts a logical row inner boundary line before the current row                                | fey_table_insert_boundary_inner_before             |
| <prefix>tis           | inserts a logical row bounary start line after the current row                                  | fey_table_insert_boundary_start_after              |
| <prefix>tiS           | inserts a logical row bounary start line before the current row                                 | fey_table_insert_boundary_start_before             |
| <prefix>tic           | insert a blank col after the current col under cursor                                           | fey_table_insert_col_after                         |
| <prefix>tiC           | insert a blank col befre the current col under curosr                                           | fey_table_insert_col_before                        |
| <prefix>tir           | insert a blank row after the current row under cursor                                           | fey_table_insert_row_after                         |
| <prefix>tiR           | insert a blank row before the current row under cursor                                          | fey_table_insert_row_before                        |
| <prefix>tid           | inserts a section divider line after the current row                                            | fey_table_insert_section_divider_after             |
| <prefix>tiD           | inserts a section divider line before the current row                                           | fey_table_insert_section_divider_before            |
| <prefix>tmS           | Merge the content of the cell above into this cell                                              | fey_table_merge_cell_content_from_above            |
| <prefix>tms           | Merge the content of the cell below into this cell                                              | fey_table_merge_cell_content_from_below            |
| <prefix>tmV           | Merge the content of the cell to the left into this cell                                        | fey_table_merge_cell_content_from_left             |
| <prefix>tmv           | Merge the content of the cell to the right into this cell                                       | fey_table_merge_cell_content_from_right            |
| <prefix>tmd           | combine current cell under cursor with cell below                                               | fey_table_merge_cell_down                          |
| <prefix>tmR           | combine current cell under cursor with cell to the left                                         | fey_table_merge_cell_left                          |
| <prefix>tmr           | combine current cell under cursor with cell to the right                                        | fey_table_merge_cell_right                         |
| <prefix>tmD           | combine current cell under cursor with cell above                                               | fey_table_merge_cell_up                            |
| <prefix>tj            | swap current cell under cursor with cell below                                                  | fey_table_move_cell_down                           |
| <prefix>th            | swap current cell under cursor with cell to the left                                            | fey_table_move_cell_left                           |
| <prefix>tl            | swap current cell under cursor with cell to the right                                           | fey_table_move_cell_right                          |
| <prefix>tk            | swap current cell under curosr with cell above                                                  | fey_table_move_cell_up                             |
| <prefix>tmh           | move the current table col under curosr left                                                    | fey_table_move_col_left                            |
| <prefix>tml           | move the current table col under curosr right                                                   | fey_table_move_col_right                           |
| <prefix>tmj           | move the current table row under cursor down                                                    | fey_table_move_row_down                            |
| <prefix>tmk           | move the current table row under cursor up                                                      | fey_table_move_row_up                              |
| <prefix>tf            | reformat table, reflowing text and aligning to a grid                                           | fey_table_reformat                                 |
| <prefix>tu            | break apart combined cells into individual cells                                                | fey_table_unmerge_cells                            |
| cit                   | Forward change TODO state of current heading                                                    | fey_todo                                           |
| ciT                   | Backward change TODO state of current heading                                                   | fey_todo_prev                                      |
| <prefix>?e <prefix>Ts | Apply settings when a note is entered, or stop doing it                                         | fey_toggle_apply_all_settings_at_buffer_enter      |
| <prefix>A             | Toggle "ARCHIVE" tag on current heading                                                         | fey_toggle_archive_tag                             |
| <C-Space>             | Toggle the checkbox of the list item (adds one when there is none), and update progress cookies | fey_toggle_checkbox                                |
| <prefix>Ti            | Show checkboxes as icons, or as written                                                         | fey_toggle_checkbox_icons                          |
| <prefix>Tc            | Show or hide the tag syntax around the todo keyword, priority and labels of headings            | fey_toggle_conceal_task_tags                       |
| <prefix>d!            | Toggle date active/inactive type                                                                | fey_toggle_date_type                               |
| <prefix>*             | Toggle current line to heading and vice versa                                                   | fey_toggle_heading                                 |
| <prefix>Tl            | Hide the head of links, or show it                                                              | fey_toggle_link_conceal                            |
| <prefix>To            | Paint the overdue dates, or stop                                                                | fey_toggle_overdue                                 |
| <prefix>Tq            | Hide queries and their result heads, or show them                                               | fey_toggle_query_conceal                           |
| <prefix>!e <prefix>Te | Run the buffer commands when a note is entered and left, or stop doing it                       | fey_toggle_run_all_buffer_commands_at_buffer_enter |
| g}                    | Go to last child heading                                                                        | last_child_heading                                 |
| g{                    | Go to parent heading                                                                            | outline_up_heading                                 |

In the agenda:

| keys       | does                                                                     | name                          |
+============+==========================================================================+===============================+
| <prefix>na | Add a note to the current heading                                        | fey_agenda_add_note           |
| <prefix>$  | Archive heading to archive file                                          | fey_agenda_archive            |
| X          | Cancel clocking on currently active clocked item                         | fey_agenda_clock_cancel       |
| <prefix>xj | Jump to currently active clock item                                      | fey_agenda_clock_goto         |
| I          | Clock in item under cursor                                               | fey_agenda_clock_in           |
| O          | Clock out currently active clocked item                                  | fey_agenda_clock_out          |
| R          | Toggle clock report for current agenda time range                        | fey_agenda_clockreport_mode   |
| vd         | Show day view                                                            | fey_agenda_day_view           |
| <prefix>id | Insert/Update deadline date on current heading                           | fey_agenda_deadline           |
| b          | Go backward one span                                                     | fey_agenda_earlier            |
| /          | Open prompt that allows filtering by category, tags and title(vim regex) | fey_agenda_filter             |
| <TAB>      | Open in another window                                                   | fey_agenda_goto               |
| J          | Jump to specific date                                                    | fey_agenda_goto_date          |
| .          | Go to today's span                                                       | fey_agenda_goto_today         |
| f          | Go forward one span                                                      | fey_agenda_later              |
| vm         | Show month view                                                          | fey_agenda_month_view         |
| <prefix>o  | Follow the first link in the item under the cursor                       | fey_agenda_open_at_point      |
| K          | Preview agenda item in floating window                                   | fey_agenda_preview            |
| <prefix>,  | Set priority for current item                                            | fey_agenda_priority           |
| -          | Decrease priority for current item                                       | fey_agenda_priority_down      |
| +          | Increase priority for current item                                       | fey_agenda_priority_up        |
| q          | Close agenda                                                             | fey_agenda_quit               |
| r          | Rebuild the agenda from the index (asks again in a match or search view) | fey_agenda_redo               |
| <prefix>r  | Refile heading to specific destination                                   | fey_agenda_refile             |
| <prefix>is | Insert/Update scheduled date on current heading                          | fey_agenda_schedule           |
| <prefix>xe | Set effort estimate for item under cursor                                | fey_agenda_set_effort         |
| <prefix>t  | Change labels of current heading                                         | fey_agenda_set_labels         |
| g?         | Show this help                                                           | fey_agenda_show_help          |
| <CR>       | Open in current window                                                   | fey_agenda_switch_to          |
| t          | Change TODO state of an item                                             | fey_agenda_todo               |
| <prefix>A  | Toggle "ARCHIVE" tag on current heading                                  | fey_agenda_toggle_archive_tag |
| vw         | Show week view                                                           | fey_agenda_week_view          |
| vy         | Show year view                                                           | fey_agenda_year_view          |

In the capture window:

| keys      | does                                                          | name                  |
+===========+===============================================================+=======================+
| <C-c>     | Write to the destination of the template and close the window | fey_capture_finalize  |
| <prefix>k | Close without saving                                          | fey_capture_kill      |
| <prefix>r | Write to a destination you pick                               | fey_capture_refile    |
| g?        | Show this help                                                | fey_capture_show_help |

In the closing note window:

| keys      | does                           | name              |
+===========+================================+===================+
| <C-c>     | Save note and close the window | fey_note_finalize |
| <prefix>k | Close without saving           | fey_note_kill     |

Text objects:

| keys | does                                    | name                     |
+======+=========================================+==========================+
| ah   | Select around heading                   | around_heading           |
| OH   | Select around heading from root heading | around_heading_from_root |
| ar   | Select around subtree                   | around_subtree           |
| OR   | Select around subtree from root heading | around_subtree_from_root |
| ih   | Select inner heading                    | inner_heading            |
| Oh   | Select inner heading from root heading  | inner_heading_from_root  |
| ir   | Select inner subtree                    | inner_subtree            |
| Or   | Select inner subtree from root heading  | inner_subtree_from_root  |


